      "predicate": "iadas:perspectives",
      "object": "The main strength of this paper was the inclusion of individual and sport environment factors in the analysis of eating disorder risk. Moreover, the study used a detailed division of sports into lean aesthetic, lean non-aesthetic, and ball sports. This allowed for the expansion of the knowledge about the risk of eating disorders among athletes participating in various types of sport. Another strength of this study was the separate analysis of adolescent and adult athletes."
